d:["$","p",null,{"children":["Regional legacy seismic interpretation across Blocks LB-26, LB-30, and LB-31 has identified ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"seven discrete Cretaceous basin floor fan systems"}],". These fans exhibit high-amplitude stratigraphic seismic anomalies analogous to major commercial petroleum discoveries in Ghana (Jubilee, TEN), Côte d'Ivoire (Baleine, Calao), and the conjugate margin in Guyana and Suriname."]}]
